    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988900/extras/07ce0f391c741e7a25746679954ad514.poster.avif?t=1723547162\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988900/extras/07ce0f391c741e7a25746679954ad514.webm?t=1723547162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988900/extras/07ce0f391c741e7a25746679954ad514.mp4?t=1723547162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\ud83c\udf73 <strong>Run Your Own Restaurant!</strong> \ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f Transform a run-down fast food place into a renowned gourmet restaurant!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Take Orders \ud83d\udcdd<br></li><li>Prepare Ingredients \ud83e\udd66<br></li><li>Plate Up the Food \ud83c\udf72<br></li><li>Keep the Restaurant Clean \ud83e\uddf9<br></li><li>Order Needed Ingredients \ud83d\udce6</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988900/extras/6603577b81b25754e39ca560fd58cfde.avif?t=1723547162\" /></div><br>\ud83d\udc65<strong> Work Alone or with Your Friends Online!</strong> \ud83e\udd1d Split up tasks and collaborate to meet the ever-increasing demands of your customers.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988900/extras/36348350c538e642e45d871f488d9d7c.avif?t=1723547162\" /></div><br>\ud83c\udf0d<strong> Choose from a Wide Array of Dishes</strong> \ud83c\udf2e\ud83c\udf55 Create your own unique dining experience with culinary delights from all over the world.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988900/extras/e94237ae7e34f508ad56d8392a6f3e17.avif?t=1723547162\" /></div><br>\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Rise Up the Ranks of Local Restaurants! </strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Unlock essential kitchen equipment and furnishings to turn your place into the best in town.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988900/extras/2e00a6ef22cdee2491da089bd55b9f4c.poster.avif?t=1723547162\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988900/extras/2e00a6ef22cdee2491da089bd55b9f4c.webm?t=1723547162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988900/extras/2e00a6ef22cdee2491da089bd55b9f4c.mp4?t=1723547162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Customize Your Restaurant</strong> \ud83c\udf89 Set the perfect ambiance and personalize every detail:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Tables \ud83d\udc81\u200d\u2640\ufe0f<br></li><li>Chairs \ud83e\ude91<br></li><li>Art \ud83c\udfa8<br></li><li>Lights \ud83d\udca1<br></li><li>Walls \ud83c\udff0<br></li><li>Floor \ud83c\udf05<br></li><li>Ceiling \ud83c\udf0c</li></ul>Get ready for an immersive and exciting restaurant management experience! Embrace the challenge, show off your culinary skills, and create the dining haven of your dreams! \ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udcbc",
